WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.062 --> 00:00:02.504
STEVE: BRIAN OVER TO YOU.

00:00:02.538 --> 00:00:04.114
BRIAN:  THANKS MEANWHILE A TEXAS

00:00:04.115 --> 00:00:05.620
SHERIFF IS ORDERING HIS DEPUTIES

00:00:05.631 --> 00:00:07.299
TO STEP UP THEIR VIGILANCE ON

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:08.554
ROADS AND HIGHWAYS NEAR THE

00:00:08.588 --> 00:00:10.117
BORDER AFTER HIS CALLS FOR

00:00:10.128 --> 00:00:11.471
ASSISTANCE FROM THE WHITE

00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:13.502
HOUSE TO COMBAT THE SURGE OF

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.405
MIGRANTS GO UNANSWERED.

00:00:15.416 --> 00:00:17.150
BEAR COUNTY SHERIFF SALAZAR

00:00:17.161 --> 00:00:18.739
WRITING AN ORDER TO PRESIDENT

00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:20.604
BIDEN LAST MONTH, "I CAN NOT

00:00:20.615 --> 00:00:22.296
STAND BY AND LET MY FELLOW LAW

00:00:22.307 --> 00:00:23.251
ENFORCEMENT OFFICERS CONTINUE TO

00:00:23.262 --> 00:00:25.188
LOSE FAITH IN YOUR LEADERSHIP

00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:26.134
AND ADMINISTRATION, PLEASE HELP

00:00:26.145 --> 00:00:26.749
US.

00:00:26.782 --> 00:00:28.980
" SHERIFF SALAZAR JOINS US NOW.

00:00:28.981 --> 00:00:30.404
YOUR ASSETS ARE BEING SHIFTED

00:00:30.415 --> 00:00:32.220
ELSEWHERE FROM THE BORDER, AND

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:34.354
NOW YOU GOT TO BE BORDER AGENTS

00:00:34.365 --> 00:00:35.527
TOO, RIGHT?

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.914
&gt;&gt;  WELL WE’RE CONCENTRATING OUR

00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:39.926
EFFORTS ON THE HIGHWAYS AND I

00:00:39.937 --> 00:00:41.511
WOULDN’T CALL IT BORDER AGENTS.

00:00:41.513 --> 00:00:42.865
WE’RE CONTINUING OUR LAW

00:00:42.899 --> 00:00:44.742
ENFORCEMENT MISSION BUT WE ARE

00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:46.005
HAVING TO CONCENTRATE MORE ON

00:00:46.016 --> 00:00:47.300
THE HIGHWAYS BECAUSE OF WHAT’S

00:00:47.335 --> 00:00:48.952
GOING ON DOWN SOUTH.

00:00:48.963 --> 00:00:50.398
BRIAN:  WHY, ASSETS BEING PUSHED

00:00:50.432 --> 00:00:50.655
ELSEWHERE?

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:51.972
&gt;&gt;  WELL FROM WHAT WE UNDERSTOOD

00:00:51.983 --> 00:00:53.235
, THEY ARE PULLING A

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.805
LOT OF BORDER PATROL ASSETS DOWN

00:00:54.816 --> 00:00:55.930
SOUTH TO THE BORDER WHICH IS

00:00:55.964 --> 00:00:56.352
UNDERSTANDABLE.

00:00:56.363 --> 00:00:58.865
THEY ARE DEALING WITH A SEA OF

00:00:58.876 --> 00:01:00.048
HUMANITY IN THAT HUMANITARIAN

00:01:00.082 --> 00:01:01.780
CRISIS, AND THEY ARE DOING WHAT

00:01:01.781 --> 00:01:03.086
THEY CAN, BUT WITH THAT BEING

00:01:03.087 --> 00:01:05.308
SAID IT’S LEAVING THE STATE

00:01:05.319 --> 00:01:06.939
VULNERABLE IN OTHER AREAS AND

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:08.027
WE’RE NOT DOING THAT.

00:01:08.061 --> 00:01:09.620
BRIAN:  WHAT ARE YOU SEEING

00:01:09.621 --> 00:01:12.458
COMING THROUGH THAT NEVER USED

00:01:12.469 --> 00:01:13.762
TO COME THROUGH BEFORE?

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.807
&gt;&gt;  IT’S AN EVERY DAY THING BUT

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.145
WE ARE CERTAINLY SEEING MORE

00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:18.631
DRUGS COMING UP NORTH, WE’RE

00:01:18.642 --> 00:01:20.763
GOING TO BE SEEING MORE GUNS AND

00:01:20.774 --> 00:01:21.685
STOLEN VEHICLES HEADING DOWN

00:01:21.686 --> 00:01:24.104
SOUTH, AND SO LOOK IT’S JUST UP

00:01:24.105 --> 00:01:25.656
TO US TO STEP UP AND FILL THAT

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:25.989
GAP.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:27.804
BRIAN:  YOU’RE NOT TALKING ABOUT

00:01:27.815 --> 00:01:28.709
DEMOCRAT OR  REPUBLICAN.

00:01:28.743 --> 00:01:29.809
YOU JUST WANT SOMETHING

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:30.751
EFFECTIVE FROM WASHINGTON.

00:01:30.784 --> 00:01:32.488
WERE YOU SURPRISED YOU DIDN’T

00:01:32.499 --> 00:01:34.097
GET ANY ANSWER FROM YOUR LETTER?

00:01:34.131 --> 00:01:35.972
&gt;&gt;  WELL, I MEAN, LOOK I KNOW

00:01:35.983 --> 00:01:36.672
THAT THE PRESIDENT’S

00:01:36.705 --> 00:01:37.860
ADMINISTRATION IS BUSY WITH

00:01:37.871 --> 00:01:39.442
WHAT’S GOING ON IN AFGHANISTAN.

00:01:39.453 --> 00:01:41.276
I KNOW THEY’VE GOT OTHER THINGS

00:01:41.287 --> 00:01:43.309
GOING ON ON A WORLDWIDE SCALE.

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.079
I CAN’T EVEN IMAGINE AND MAKE NO

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:46.355
MISTAKE ABOUT IT I DO SUPPORT MY

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:48.220
PRESIDENT, BUT WITH THAT BEING

00:01:48.231 --> 00:01:50.641
SAID THAT’S WHY I FEEL THAT IT’S

00:01:50.675 --> 00:01:52.609
MY PLACE TO ASK FOR MORE, IN

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.696
TALKING TO SOME SHERIFFS FROM

00:01:54.707 --> 00:01:57.134
DOWN SOUTH AT THE BORDER,

00:01:57.145 --> 00:01:58.338
REPUBLICAN AND DEMOCRAT THEY

00:01:58.373 --> 00:01:59.923
FEEL LEFT BEHIND.

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:02.899
THEY FEEL LEFT OUT, AND SO I’M

00:02:02.933 --> 00:02:04.693
ACTUALLY FLYING DOWN SOUTH LATER

00:02:04.695 --> 00:02:06.318
THIS MORNING WITH DPS TO GO GET

00:02:06.329 --> 00:02:07.595
A LOOK AT IT.

00:02:07.606 --> 00:02:09.645
I’LL PROBABLY BE MEETING UP WITH

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:11.393
ONE OF THE LOCAL SHERIFF’S DOWN

00:02:11.404 --> 00:02:13.502
THERE, MARTINEZ, TO SEE WHAT WE

00:02:13.536 --> 00:02:14.745
CAN DO TO HELP.

00:02:14.756 --> 00:02:16.267
BRIAN:  SHERIFF WHAT ABOUT YOUR

00:02:16.301 --> 00:02:17.316
MAYOR AND YOUR GOVERNOR?

00:02:17.318 --> 00:02:19.635
&gt;&gt;  WELL LOOK THE GOVERNOR, I

00:02:19.646 --> 00:02:22.668
CAN’T SAY THAT I AGREE WITH HIS

00:02:22.679 --> 00:02:24.730
POLICY, LOCKING UP A LOT OF

00:02:24.763 --> 00:02:26.426
THESE UNDOCUMENTED IMMIGRANTS IN

00:02:26.437 --> 00:02:27.969
THE STATE PRISON BECAUSE WHAT

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.939
THAT’S DOING IS CAUSING A

00:02:29.973 --> 00:02:31.409
BACKLOG IN THE PRISON SYSTEM

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.775
WHICH IS IN TURN AFFECTING MY

00:02:32.786 --> 00:02:34.258
JAIL POPULATION AND MY DEPUTIES

00:02:34.269 --> 00:02:35.584
ARE WORKING OVERTIME TO KEEP UP

00:02:35.595 --> 00:02:37.446
WITH THE JAIL POPULATION SO IT’S

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:39.838
A DOMINO EFFECT SO THAT’S WHY I

00:02:39.849 --> 00:02:41.303
SAY, BORDER PROBLEMS ARE BEAR

00:02:41.337 --> 00:02:42.541
COUNTY PROBLEMS BY DEFAULT AND

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:43.647
WE’LL DO EVERYTHING IN OUR POWER

00:02:43.648 --> 00:02:44.287
TO HELP.

00:02:44.298 --> 00:02:45.936
BRIAN:  JUST GIVE THEM A HAND,

00:02:45.947 --> 00:02:47.401
SHERIFF IS DOING EVERYTHING HE

00:02:47.412 --> 00:02:49.312
CAN WITH THE STAFF HE HAS BUT

00:02:49.323 --> 00:02:50.562
HE’S BEING OVERWHELMED AND IT

00:02:50.573 --> 00:02:52.907
AFFECTS EVERYONE, NOT JUST

